MossFormer2 Speech Separation — MLX Swift port
==============================================

This directory is a Swift/MLX port of the MossFormer2 speech separation
model from ClearerVoice-Studio.

Upstream project: https://github.com/modelscope/ClearerVoice-Studio
Upstream licence: Apache License, Version 2.0

Upstream's LICENSE is the unmodified Apache-2.0 text with the copyright
placeholder left unfilled, so it names no individual copyright holder.
The project is published by the ModelScope / Alibaba Group ClearerVoice
team.

Note: this covers the source in this directory only. The WHAMR-trained
model weights distributed for this model carry their own licence (MIT);
see Docs/licenses.md for the weight-by-weight breakdown.

